note top of TriagePipeline
  <b>SRP / DIP:</b> the pipeline has no menu and never prints.
  It talks to an <b>OutputView</b> and a list of <b>Notifier</b>s,
  so the CLI (ConsoleUI + ConsoleNotifier) and the GUI
  (GuiWindow + GuiNotifier) reuse it unchanged.
  <b>main.py</b> (no class) builds the objects for either front end.
end note

legend right
  <b>Legend</b>
  |= Concept |= Notation |
  | <color:#2F6DB5><b>Encapsulation</b></color> | <b>-</b> private, <b>+</b> public |
  | <color:#2F6DB5><b>Association</b></color> | solid ──> (uses, doesn't own) |
  | <color:#D9652B><b>Aggregation</b></color> | hollow ◇── at whole |
  |<back:#F4F4F4> grey dashed box </back>| class from another diagram |
endlegend
@enduml
